<p class="note mb-2">You need to <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/security-hardening-your-deployments/configuring-openid-connect-in-azure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="Link--inTextBlock">configure a federated credential in Azure AD</a> that trusts GitHub's OIDC provider before Dependabot can authenticate.</p>
<div class="form-group">
  <div class="form-group-header">
    <label for="tenant_id">Tenant ID</label>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group-body">
    <%= text_field_tag :tenant_id, local_assigns[:configuration]&.tenant_id, required: true, placeholder: "Azure AD Tenant ID (GUID)", class: "form-control", data: { "test-selector": "private-registry-tenant-id" } %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="form-group">
  <div class="form-group-header">
    <label for="client_id">Client ID</label>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group-body">
    <%= text_field_tag :client_id, local_assigns[:configuration]&.client_id, required: true, placeholder: "Azure AD Client ID (GUID)", class: "form-control", data: { "test-selector": "private-registry-client-id" } %>
  </div>
</div>
